00:27:18.460 --> 00:27:20.795
And that's the
beauty of functions.

00:27:20.795 --> 00:27:22.170
You don't need to
do many things.

00:27:22.170 --> 00:27:23.795
Actually, you shouldn't
do many things.

00:27:23.795 --> 00:27:26.560
You just do one thing at a
time, and once you're done,

00:27:26.560 --> 00:27:29.380
you just reply back
with your reply.

00:27:29.380 --> 00:27:32.557
And that said, there's not much
complicated logic in functions,

00:27:32.557 --> 00:27:34.140
