00:29:36.493 --> 00:29:38.410
that we see in the resize
image and the labels

00:29:38.410 --> 00:29:42.400
into a new image, and we upload
that back to Cloud Storage.

00:29:42.400 --> 00:29:43.900
And you can look
at the code, if you

00:29:43.900 --> 00:29:48.490
like, in terms of how we do
this watermarking, if you want.

00:29:48.490 --> 00:29:50.110
All right, so once
